{"id":"f753356251a9-0333","source":"references/pptset/【加赠】700页逻辑图形 (1).pptx","sourcePage":333,"slideXmlSha256":"f0cbc18810f7a91ccf89ed04c40b7e54bca7f4ba18912da2d2b3d9d5efe43e0a","slots":[{"anchor":"s286-s284","text":"A revenue model is a framework for generating financial income. It identifies which revenue source to pursue, what value to offer, how to price the value, and who pays for the value. It is a key component of a company's business model. It primarily identifies what product or service will be created in order to generate revenues and the ways in which the product or service will be sold.\n\nWithout a clear and well-defined revenue model, with a clear plan of how to generate revenues, new businesses will more likely struggle due to costs which they will not be able to sustain. By having a clear revenue model, a business can focus on a target audience, fund development plans for a product or service, establish marketing plans, begin a line of credit and raise capital.","box":[0.0933,0.3559,0.3772,0.4282]},{"anchor":"s286-s285","text":"6 Steps revenue assurance protection and monitoring ","box":[0.0929,0.219,0.3708,0.1107]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s307","text":"Revenue\nAssurance","box":[0.6741,0.4689,0.103,0.0479]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s308","text":"Monitor revenue streams","box":[0.772,0.6207,0.0835,0.0815]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s309","text":"Present reports and data","box":[0.6015,0.6207,0.0706,0.0815]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s310","text":"Optimize RA process","box":[0.5933,0.3275,0.0835,0.0568]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s311","text":"Act or Correct issues","box":[0.5698,0.4661,0.0645,0.0815]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s312","text":"Define RA controls","box":[0.8157,0.4772,0.0645,0.0568]},{"anchor":"s321-s314-s313","text":"Identify risks","box":[0.7814,0.3275,0.0645,0.0568]},{"anchor":"s3","text":"6 Steps revenue assurance protection and monitoring ","box":[0.0283,0.0378,0.9417,0.0673]}],"warnings":[],"stats":{"objects":40,"textBlocks":10},"reconstructedSlots":[{"ancho